OL,3,GNEWSASafety framework for public events
OL,4,A'insufficient'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inspection of policing and public
OL,7,Fsafety at large events has concluded
OL,8,Fthat guidance to manage risks at
OL,9,Fgatherings like festivals and concerts
OL,10,Fis "inconsistent" and increasingly
OL,11,Funable to guarantee public safety.
OL,13,FThe HM Inspectorate of Constabulary and
OL,14,FFire & Rescue Services report was
OL,15,Fcommissioned after controversy
OL,16,Finvolving Aston Villa's European
OL,17,Ffixture against Israeli side Maccabi
OL,18,FTel Aviv in November.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
