OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSASafety framework for public events
OL,4,A'insufficient'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham Safety Advisory Group
OL,7,Frecommended no away supporters should
OL,8,Fattend the match because of public
OL,9,Fsafety concerns - prompting an
OL,10,Finternational outcry.
OL,12,FChief Inspector of Constabulary
OL,13,FMichelle Skeer urged government to
OL,14,Freview wider arrangements for keeping
OL,15,Fthe public safe at events.
